Third-party notices

The built extension embeds the following third-party code. Each licence is
reproduced in full below, as its terms require. This file ships in the packaged
extension alongside the code it covers.

Nothing here is loaded at runtime from a network: the extension's content
security policy forbids remote script, so every dependency is compiled into the
bundle at build time and travels with it.

